==================================

Where `&&`, `||`, `and`, `or` and `xor` outside a condition stand at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `lineEnd`: one opening a line ends the one before, unless a comment precedes it
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `lineStart`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `lineStart`, laravel `keep` · covers `operator_linebreak` .[decision-facts]


